on</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Carpenter</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiasson</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><volume>3</volume><issue>2</issue><article-title>Diet, Activity, and Overweight Among Preschool-Age Children Enrolled in the Special Supplemental Nutrition Program for Women, Infants, and Children (WIC)</article-title><source>Prev Chronic Dis</source><fpage>A49</fpage><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2006/apr/05_0135.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2006/apr/05_0135.htm</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16539790</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Becerra</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Oda</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Donohue</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><volume>120</volume><issue>1</issue><year>2007</year><fpage>e112</fpage><lpage>e199</lpage><article-title>Parental ability to discriminate the weight status of children: results of a survey</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17606538</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>American</surname><given-names>Academy</given-names><suffix>of</suffix></name><name><surname>Committee</surname><given-names>on</given-names><suffix>Practice</suffix></name></person-group><year>2000</year><fpage>645</fpage><lpage>646</lpage><volume>105</volume><article-title>American Academy of Pediatrics, Committee on Practice and Ambulatory C